Converted by Alakazam Labs. The file dfn3_ll.nnef.tar is a modified form of
DeepFilterNet3_ll_onnx.tar.gz from the authors' repository (models/, commit
978576aa8400552a4ce9730838c635aa30db5e61, the v0.5.6 tag): the ONNX graphs' float32 weights
were renamed and stored as NNEF tensor files, values unchanged, with an NNEF graph that declares
them; the graphs' operators are not included. The archive's README.txt says the same.

Sew's noise removal (the sew-noise crate, cargo feature dfn3) runs this model with its own
inference code.

From the authors' README (at commit 978576aa8400552a4ce9730838c635aa30db5e61), word for word:

